{"schemaVersion":1,"skill":{"id":"heygen-com--hyperframes--hyperframes-audio","name":"hyperframes-audio","description":"Use when audio already placed in a HyperFrames composition needs to be mixed: fade-in/fade-out, crossfade, track gain or volume, volume automation, ducking, a music bed that fights a voiceover (voiceover carve), effects on a track (EQ, compressor, limiter, gate, saturation, delay, reverb, chorus, phaser, bitcrush), automation envelopes drawn on a track's volume or any effect parameter, or one submix bus carrying a chain, a fader and an automation clock for several tracks at once (`<hf-audio-group>`). Don't use for sourcing or generating audio — finding BGM, SFX, or making a voiceover is `/media-use`. Don't use for clip timing or track layout, which is `/hyperframes-core`.","category":"Video & audio","tags":["hyperframes","audio","when","already","placed","composition","needs","be","mixed","fade","out","crossfade","track","gain","volume","automation","ducking","music"],"repo":"heygen-com/hyperframes","owner":"heygen-com","stars":52761,"official":true,"featured":false,"license":"Apache-2.0","licensePath":"LICENSE","revision":"58c873d8161d6a2357eacf89a540bfecc359349b","path":"skills/hyperframes-audio","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/tree/58c873d8161d6a2357eacf89a540bfecc359349b/skills/hyperframes-audio","checkedAt":"2026-09-24T09:18:44.317Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-24T06:32:31Z","fileCount":8,"bytes":110799,"sha256":"02ba8082a3654b7f8d8fc6d2d322b2828abb1e6dd455fb1ff14728e6e6c89a1e","historical":false},"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","sourcePath":"skills/hyperframes-audio/SKILL.md","bytes":25578,"sha256":"02ba8082a3654b7f8d8fc6d2d322b2828abb1e6dd455fb1ff14728e6e6c89a1e","mode":420,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/58c873d8161d6a2357eacf89a540bfecc359349b/skills/hyperframes-audio/SKILL.md"},{"path":"references/attributes.md","sourcePath":"skills/hyperframes-audio/references/attributes.md","bytes":6216,"sha25